<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68018" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μισθόφορ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>serving for hire</i> or
				<i>pay</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ἄνθρωποι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					23.123
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δικαστήρια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1274a9
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ath.</u>
				27.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνὴρ μ. ἐν λόγοις</span> a
				<i>mercenary</i> in argument, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				165d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. στρατιῶται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archestr.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					61
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. κληροῦχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PPetr.</u>
					3p.286
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ἱππεῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PGrenf.</u>
					2.31.5
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θανάτου μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					266
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. τριήρεις</span> galleys <i>manned with
				mercenaries</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				555
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μισθοφόροι, οἱ</span>, <i>mercenaries</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.35
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				5.4.45
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
